Package: flipmeta
Title: Robust Score Tests for Meta-Analysis Using Sign Flips
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    c(person("Filippo", "Gambarota", email = "filippo.gambarota@unipd.it", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6666-1747")),
      person("Livio", "Finos", email = "livio.finos@unipd.it", role = c("ctb"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-3181-8078")),
      person("Matteo", "Manente", email = "matteo.manente.3@phd.unipd.it", role = c("ctb"), comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0009-3246-3476")))
Description: Performs robust score tests for univariate meta-analytic and
    meta-regression models fitted with 'metafor'. Study-level score
    contributions are randomly sign-flipped to provide inference for individual
    models and joint inference across related model specifications, including
    multiplicity-adjusted p-values.
